  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Unnerving Shout\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Unnerving-shout.png\" title=\"Image:Unnerving-shout.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Unnerving-shout.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Unnerving-shout.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Skill Type: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Curses\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Trainer: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Warrior\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Number of Ranks: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Cost to Max: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">300676\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Lowers the Attack speed by Y% and Movement Speed by Z% at X amount of creatures for W Seconds\n</td></tr></table>\n<p><b>Unnerving Shout</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Curses\" title=\"Curses\">Curse skill</a> That will lower the Attack Speed and Movement speed at a certain amount of creatures for a certain amount of seconds. It has the same animation as <a href=\"/wiki/Righteous_Stomp\" title=\"Righteous Stomp\">Righteous Stomp</a> but then not in Yellow but in Purple. This skill can be very handy at <a href=\"/wiki/PvP\" title=\"PvP\">PvP</a>.\n</p><p>This skill can be upgraded at the  <a href=\"/wiki/Skill_trainers\" title=\"Skill trainers\">skill trainers</a>. Below is a Chart that shows howmany % the attack speed and movement speed will be lowered for howmany enemies, and for how many seconds it will last at a certain level.\n</p><p><b>Cool down:</b> 25 Seconds\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n<b>A bone rattling shout that unnerves up to X enemies within 4.5 meters, slowing their Attack Speed by Y% and Movement Speed by Z% for W seconds</b>\n</p>\n<table align=\"left\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center; width:100%; background:rgb(240,240,240);\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">1\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">2\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">3\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">4\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td> 8\n</td><td> 31\n</td><td> 54\n</td><td> 77\n</td><td> 100\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">X\n</td><td> 11\n</td><td> 15\n</td><td> 18\n</td><td> 21\n</td><td> 24\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Y\n</td><td> 5\n</td><td> 10\n</td><td> 15\n</td><td> 20\n</td><td> 25\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Z\n</td><td> 15\n</td><td> 30\n</td><td> 45\n</td><td> 60\n</td><td> 75\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">W\n</td><td> 12\n</td><td> 13\n</td><td> 14\n</td><td> 15\n</td><td> 16\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Mana\n</td><td> 39.4\n</td><td> 95.3\n</td><td> 151.2\n</td><td> 207.1\n</td><td> 263\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Upgrade Cost\n</td><td> 8908\n</td><td> 34522\n</td><td> 60135\n</td><td> 85749\n</td><td> 111362\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<table>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
